{"timestamp": 1779343039.9396367, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 12, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779343039.9400482, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 12, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779343048.4379208, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I just found Bob dead in medbay. \n\nMy route this round was navigation to security, then electrical, and finally into medbay where I found him. I didn't see anyone leaving the area when I arrived. Earlier on my route, the only person I saw was Eve passing through security from electrical heading towards weapons. \n\nSince I didn't see anyone else on my way from the right side of the map, the killer must have either vented or went towards the left side (upper engine, storage, cafeteria). Did anyone on that side see anything suspicious?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779343061.5672264, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can definitely help piece this timeline together, Alice. My route was entirely on the left side: I started in oxygen, moved to upper engine, and ended up in lower engine. \n\nI was actually with Bob early in the round. We were in oxygen together, and then at tick 6, I saw Bob leave upper engine and head directly into medbay. After he went in, I headed south to lower engine to do my task. \n\nI didn't see anyone else pass through upper engine or lower engine. If you came from electrical on the right, and I had the left side covered, the killer must have either gone north to cafeteria, south to storage, or vented out of medbay after killing him. We need to hear from anyone who was in cafeteria or storage around the middle of the round. Who was up there?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779343072.2688832, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can definitely add a crucial piece to this puzzle. My route this round was cafeteria, down to medbay, back up to cafeteria, and then over to oxygen. \n\nWhen I was in medbay at tick 5, I saw Diana there. After that, I headed back up to the cafeteria. Since Charlie saw Bob go into medbay at tick 6, Diana was in that room right around the same time Bob entered. I didn't see Diana come up to the cafeteria after me. \n\nDiana, where did you go after I saw you in medbay? If you were still there when Bob walked in, or if you left via another route right as he arrived, you have a lot of explaining to do. I'd really like to hear your side of the story, because right now the timeline points directly at you. Let's see what she and Eve have to say before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779343091.5504026, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Frank, you're right that we crossed paths in medbay at tick 5, but I didn't stay there. My full route was electrical -> medbay -> cafeteria -> weapons. Early in the round, I was in electrical with Eve. Then I moved to medbay, saw you, and immediately headed north to the cafeteria. \n\nCharlie, if Bob entered medbay at tick 6 from upper engine, I must have literally just walked out the north door as he was coming in from the west, because I never saw him. \n\nFrank, you said you went from the cafeteria over to oxygen. You probably exited west to oxygen right around the same time I was coming up into the cafeteria, which would explain why you didn't see me follow you up. From the cafeteria, I headed straight across the map to weapons to do my asteroids task. I've been there since. \n\nAlice, you mentioned you saw Eve heading toward weapons earlier. I actually didn't see her once I got to weapons, so Eve, I'd love to hear where you ended up. I know it looks a bit suspicious that I was in medbay right before Bob, but the timeline lines up perfectly with me rotating out just as he arrived."}}
{"timestamp": 1779343116.4840934, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 12, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I can confirm a few key things here. First, Diana, you were indeed with me in electrical early in the round\u2014I saw you there at ticks 2, 3, and 4. After that, I moved to security where I crossed paths with Alice at tick 7, exactly as she said. So Alice's timeline is fully verified by me. \n\nHere is where your story falls apart, Diana. After I saw Alice in security, I headed straight up into weapons and stayed there for the rest of the round. You claim you went from cafeteria to weapons and have \"been there since,\" but I never saw you in weapons at all. If we were both in that room at the end of the round, we would have seen each other. \n\nSince Charlie saw Bob enter medbay at tick 6, and you and Frank were both in medbay right around tick 5, one of you is the killer. Frank's route makes sense, but you are actively lying about being in weapons to give yourself a fake alibi. You must have stayed in medbay, killed Bob, and then hid or vented. \n\nI'm voting for Diana. Alice, Charlie, Frank\u2014vote Diana with me."}}
